sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EDGE as Edge (edge/)
    participant API as Backend ingest API (/api/v1)
    participant BUS as RabbitMQ (domain events)
    participant SVC as Parking module (slot service)
    participant REDIS as Redis pub/sub (STOMP relay)
    participant WS as STOMP endpoint (/ws)
    participant UI as Dashboard Parking Map View

    EDGE->>API: POST vehicle event (VehicleEntered/VehicleRelocated)
    API->>API: persist ParkingEvent + outbox row (same tx)
    API-->>EDGE: 202 Accepted (idempotent by event_id)
    API->>BUS: relay outbox row (transactional outbox)
    BUS->>SVC: consume ParkingEvent
    SVC->>SVC: recompute ParkingSlot.status/current_vehicle_id
    SVC->>REDIS: publish slot-occupancy-changed {siteId, slotId, status}
    REDIS->>WS: fan out to all backend instances
    WS-->>UI: STOMP message /topic/site/{siteId}/slots
    UI->>UI: update slot polygon fill (occupied/free) in place
    Note over UI: falls back to GET /sites/{siteId}/parking-status<br/>on reconnect (missed-event replay, like today's<br/>recent-checks pattern)
